#: ../../../faq/advanced-serial-monitor.rst:15
msgid "Advanced Serial Monitor with UI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../faq/advanced-serial-monitor.rst:17
msgid ""
"PlatformIO Core provides CLI version (:ref:`cmd_device_monitor`) of Serial "
"Monitor. If you need advanced instrument with a rich UI, we recommend free "
"and multi-platform `CoolTerm <https://freeware.the-meiers.org/?"
"utm_source=platformio&utm_medium=docs>`_ serial port terminal application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../faq/advanced-serial-monitor.rst:23
msgid ""
"Please note that you need to **manually disconnect (close serial port "
"connection)** in CoolTerm **before doing uploading** in PlatformIO. "
"PlatformIO can not disconnect/connect to a target device automatically when "
"CoolTerm is used."
msgstr ""
